Package: birdtray
Version: 1.13.0-1~resolute1
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Birdtray community build
Section: mail
Priority: optional
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6 (>= 12), libqt5core5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5gui5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5network5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5widgets5t64 (>= 5.15.18), libqt5svg5, libqt5x11extras5, libx11-6
Suggests: thunderbird
Homepage: https://github.com/WonderSkydive/birdtray
Description: Thunderbird tray unread counter with X11 recovery fixes
 Community modification based on Birdtray 1.11.4 for Ubuntu 26.04 amd64.
 Restores lost index watches and bounds continuous-change read delays.
 Uses the standard Birdtray executable and configuration paths.
